  "slug": "in-process-quality-report-form",
  "title": "In-Process Quality Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile the in-process inspection and control check population, summarize evidence and trends, separate limitations from conclusions, assign decisions, and track follow-up.",
  "description": "A decision-ready in-process quality report form that turns source records for a work-in-process lot or serial range into reconciled measures, exception patterns, qualified conclusions, owned actions, and a retrievable reporting package.",
  "use_case": "Use when the production and quality response owner needs a bounded quality report for the in-process inspection and control check rather than a raw inspection checklist or chronological log.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
